## openvela 快应用 Sensor API

openvela (openvela) is an open-source IoT/embedded operating system based on Apache NuttX. It supports **快应用 (Quick App)** development for various devices, including sensor-related capabilities.

### sensor.subscribe API

The typical sensor API in openvela quick apps follows this pattern:

```javascript
import sensor from '@system.sensor';

// 订阅加速度传感器 (Accelerometer)
sensor.subscribe({
  sensorType: 'accelerometer',
  interval: 200,  // 采样间隔(ms)
  success: function(data) {
    console.log('加速度: x=' + data.x + ', y=' + data.y + ', z=' + data.z);
  },
  fail: function(data, code) {
    console.log('订阅失败: ' + code);
  }
});

// 订阅陀螺仪传感器 (Gyroscope)
sensor.subscribe({
  sensorType: 'gyroscope',
  interval: 200,
  success: function(data) {
    console.log('陀螺仪: x=' + data.x + ', y=' + data.y + ', z=' + data.z);
  }
});

// 取消订阅
sensor.unsubscribe({
  sensorType: 'accelerometer'
});
```

